# Site brand assets in public/ are deliberate, checked-in deliverables — the root
# `.gitignore` `*.png` rule exists for screenshots/test artifacts, so re-include
# the directories that carry first-party images (og cards, logo, banner).
!public/og/
!public/og/**
!public/brand/
!public/brand/**
!public/logo.png

